{"id":"wb-5-306","name":"郑义门古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"郑义门古建筑群","text":"郑义门古建筑群位于中国浙江省浦江县郑宅镇，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n郑氏于南宋建炎元年（1127年）开始倡义居同炊，至明天顺三年（1459年）大火，共历十五世三百余年未曾分家，在推崇孝行的时代闻名全国，史称郑义门。郑义门古建筑群以郑氏宗祠（清嘉庆二年重建）为中心，四周分布有孝感泉、九世同居碑亭、东明书院、玄麓八景、宋濂故址、崇义桥、老佛社、圣谕楼、昌七公祠、垂裕堂等元明清建筑五十余处。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%83%91%E4%B9%89%E9%97%A8%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":91762889,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91762889","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ae35ebe611aa585666ffa58b.jpg","title":"Pujiang_Zhengzhai_Zhengshi_Zongci_2015.05.23_14-33-16.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pujiang_Zhengzhai_Zhengshi_Zongci_2015.05.23_14-33-16.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/Pujiang_Zhengzhai_Zhengshi_Zongci_2015.05.23_14-33-16.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"浦江县郑宅镇郑义门古建筑群——郑氏宗祠\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}